WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 24]

01:49.340 --> 01:51.780
[One Month Earlier]

02:06.900 --> 02:07.700
Stay still.

02:08.980 --> 02:10.540
The wound is just starting to scab.

02:15.100 --> 02:15.940
Take it easy.

02:20.540 --> 02:21.380
I am alive?

02:21.700 --> 02:22.420
Yes.

02:22.660 --> 02:23.420
Even the Underworld

02:23.740 --> 02:25.540
wouldn't dare claim a soul with such a baleful aura.

02:26.500 --> 02:27.380
It's a blessing

02:28.340 --> 02:29.860
to be alive.

02:30.620 --> 02:31.220
Here,

02:31.980 --> 02:32.860
have some water.

02:40.700 --> 02:41.820
Careful.

02:43.100 --> 02:45.220
The wound missed

02:45.660 --> 02:47.140
your heart by a hair.

02:50.420 --> 02:51.340
What about the Northern Desert King?

02:51.700 --> 02:52.700
Nothing left to bury.

02:53.260 --> 02:54.620
With the internal strife over there,

02:54.940 --> 02:56.300
they will not be able to bother us for a while.

03:01.940 --> 03:02.660
Do not move.

03:02.660 --> 03:04.220
Why are you so stubborn?

03:04.220 --> 03:04.620
Lie back down.

03:05.540 --> 03:06.340
I must go back.

03:07.020 --> 03:07.820
I know

03:08.300 --> 03:09.860
you are longing to see Zhao.

03:10.220 --> 03:11.540
But surviving comes first,

03:11.540 --> 03:12.300
alright?

03:13.180 --> 03:14.620
The Capital is in turmoil,

03:14.940 --> 03:15.660
but rest assured.

03:16.380 --> 03:17.300
I will find someone

03:17.380 --> 03:18.580
to let her know you are alive.

03:19.220 --> 03:20.580
Besides, if you go there now,

03:20.860 --> 03:22.540
how would you protect her?

03:27.220 --> 03:28.140
Zhao,

03:29.620 --> 03:30.380
wait for me.

03:36.560 --> 03:38.820
[One Day Earlier]

03:40.500 --> 03:41.220
Jiu.

03:43.700 --> 03:44.940
The moon is full again.

04:01.180 --> 04:05.300
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

04:05.860 --> 04:08.700
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

04:08.700 --> 04:11.860
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

04:16.300 --> 04:18.700
♪Through biting winds and frost I go♪

04:19.180 --> 04:21.500
♪I light a lamp, my lone abode♪

04:22.180 --> 04:23.580
♪Half my life adrift♪

04:23.820 --> 04:27.700
♪This lonely shadow finds no haven to moor♪

04:30.100 --> 04:30.900
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

04:30.900 --> 04:31.700
Jiu.

04:32.380 --> 04:34.180
♪And roars in the blaze♪

04:34.180 --> 04:37.260
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

04:37.940 --> 04:40.180
♪Fate imprisons me♪

04:40.180 --> 04:44.900
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

04:45.140 --> 04:49.460
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

04:49.460 --> 04:53.540
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

04:53.540 --> 04:56.140
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

04:56.140 --> 04:57.060
It really is you.

04:58.940 --> 05:00.700
♪With no fear of the distance♪

05:00.700 --> 05:04.700
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

05:05.220 --> 05:05.980
It's me.

05:05.980 --> 05:08.860
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

05:09.460 --> 05:13.980
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

05:14.300 --> 05:18.260
♪My new pride♪

05:31.340 --> 05:32.580
Your Highness, you shouldn't go.

05:37.820 --> 05:39.740
Xie Yanfang has been plotting for so long,

05:41.020 --> 05:43.020
all for this trap at the hunting grounds.

05:44.780 --> 05:45.820
If I don't walk into it,

05:46.980 --> 05:48.020
how can he reveal his true colors?

05:48.980 --> 05:50.580
What if he truly intends to kill you?

05:58.780 --> 05:59.580
Then I'll bet

06:03.260 --> 06:04.180
on who can outlast

06:06.020 --> 06:07.180
the other.

06:12.740 --> 06:13.540
Yanlai?

06:16.020 --> 06:17.220
You're alive.

06:20.620 --> 06:23.060
Xie Yanfang.

06:24.420 --> 06:25.700
Frontier Troops, heed my command.

06:28.860 --> 06:29.340
This is

06:30.460 --> 06:31.900
the Token to mobilize the frontier troops.

06:32.340 --> 06:33.700
Seize the rebel,

06:34.780 --> 06:35.700
Xie Yanlai, at once.

06:52.580 --> 06:54.300
You have survived a brush with death.

06:55.940 --> 06:57.980
How gratifying.

06:59.660 --> 07:00.700
It's a pity, though,

07:02.620 --> 07:04.460
that someone will die.

07:07.340 --> 07:08.140
Do not harm her!

07:09.700 --> 07:10.380
What,

07:13.060 --> 07:14.460
does your heart ache for her?

07:16.260 --> 07:17.820
Then go die in her stead,

07:18.020 --> 07:19.860
using this poisoned dagger Her Highness prepared

07:19.860 --> 07:21.660
for the two of us.

07:21.660 --> 07:22.580
Don't listen to him.

07:23.260 --> 07:24.300
Frontier Troops, heed my command.

07:24.740 --> 07:25.360
Execute...

07:25.380 --> 07:26.540
Your Highness, have you forgotten

07:27.700 --> 07:29.780
the Frontier Troops answer only to this token?

07:30.300 --> 07:32.140
You told me that yourself.

07:37.100 --> 07:37.780
Yanlai.

07:39.620 --> 07:40.180
Do it!

07:40.220 --> 07:40.820
Stop!

07:44.780 --> 07:45.460
Don't.

07:55.860 --> 07:56.500
Don't.

07:56.900 --> 07:58.340
The dagger is poisoned.

07:58.860 --> 07:59.460
Indeed,

08:00.300 --> 08:02.380
the Golden Finch Venom has no cure.

08:03.460 --> 08:05.100
Think carefully

08:06.620 --> 08:09.340
whether her life is worth yours.

08:10.060 --> 08:10.660
No.

08:11.300 --> 08:12.620
Jiu, don't.

08:13.420 --> 08:13.980
Jiu.

08:14.180 --> 08:14.980
Will you keep

08:17.300 --> 08:18.660
your word?

08:19.580 --> 08:21.060
- Certainly. - Jiu.

08:21.780 --> 08:22.940
Don't.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.420
The dagger is poisoned.

08:25.820 --> 08:26.380
Don't.

08:41.620 --> 08:42.260
That will do.

08:51.380 --> 08:52.260
Let them leave.

09:01.180 --> 09:01.820
Mr. Xie,

09:02.140 --> 09:03.300
why let them go?

09:03.660 --> 09:04.980
I want to see

09:07.260 --> 09:09.020
how a cornered beast

09:09.860 --> 09:11.940
breaks out of its cage.

09:14.900 --> 09:17.020
Mr. Xie, please take this first.

09:32.900 --> 09:33.460
Jiu.

09:34.140 --> 09:34.700
Jiu.

09:35.180 --> 09:35.740
Jiu.

09:36.100 --> 09:36.620
Jiu.

09:37.780 --> 09:38.300
Jiu.

09:38.660 --> 09:39.260
Jiu.

09:39.940 --> 09:40.500
Jiu.

09:48.020 --> 09:48.780
I'm sorry.

09:50.380 --> 09:51.340
I feel utterly useless

09:52.980 --> 09:54.780
for failing to kill Xie Yanfang for you.

09:56.420 --> 09:57.340
Don't worry about me.

10:00.300 --> 10:00.900
Go.

10:02.860 --> 10:03.460
Go.

10:03.460 --> 10:04.420
Jiu, don't fall asleep.

10:04.620 --> 10:05.980
I don't need you to kill him for me.

10:06.260 --> 10:06.820
Jiu.

10:07.460 --> 10:08.820
We were of the same blood.

10:10.380 --> 10:11.860
Yanlai, I must trouble you

10:13.740 --> 10:15.940
to join me on the road to the afterlife.

10:17.380 --> 10:18.100
Chu Zhao,

10:19.260 --> 10:20.620
can we have

10:21.380 --> 10:23.140
a proper talk now?

10:24.020 --> 10:25.900
Do you truly wish

10:26.380 --> 10:28.580
to watch him die in such agony?

10:29.980 --> 10:31.940
I know the Golden Finch Venom.

10:32.900 --> 10:33.820
As it takes effect,

10:34.620 --> 10:37.100
it feels like fire burning through one's internal organs

10:38.020 --> 10:39.700
before one coughs up blood and dies.

10:40.500 --> 10:42.380
His face will contort,

10:43.740 --> 10:45.340
his body will wither,

10:45.860 --> 10:47.300
and he will die slowly

10:47.740 --> 10:49.560
in agony.

10:49.560 --> 10:50.520
Zhao, don't believe him.

10:50.520 --> 10:51.120
Chu Zhao.

10:53.040 --> 10:54.860
Do you want to save him?

10:55.020 --> 10:55.700
Zhao.

10:58.620 --> 10:59.580
Don't listen to him.

11:00.500 --> 11:02.540
He came for you, and he is dying for you.

11:03.500 --> 11:05.300
Do you really not want to save him?

11:07.620 --> 11:09.660
You should.

11:13.980 --> 11:16.340
This is the Nanjiang Millennium Snow Lingzhi.

11:16.980 --> 11:17.940
It can keep him alive.

11:18.860 --> 11:20.020
As long as I live,

11:22.540 --> 11:24.180
so shall he.

11:27.300 --> 11:27.900
Zhao.

11:28.400 --> 11:28.820
Zhao.

11:28.880 --> 11:30.060
How ironic.

11:30.740 --> 11:32.340
You intended to kill me,

11:34.020 --> 11:34.900
yet you've ended up

11:34.900 --> 11:36.780
killing your most beloved.

11:38.020 --> 11:38.620
Zhao.

11:40.100 --> 11:40.660
Zhao.

11:43.020 --> 11:44.780
Don't listen to him.

11:45.140 --> 11:46.140
I'm not afraid of death.

11:47.620 --> 11:48.540
Don't agree to his terms.

11:49.500 --> 11:50.260
I beg you.

12:10.860 --> 12:11.460
Zhao.

12:17.660 --> 12:18.740
Are you still

12:20.620 --> 12:22.380
thinking of killing me?

12:25.260 --> 12:26.700
Then think carefully.

12:28.620 --> 12:29.580
If I die,

12:30.620 --> 12:32.460
Yanlai dies with me.

12:33.260 --> 12:34.260
Will you kill me,

12:35.060 --> 12:37.140
or save your beloved?

12:39.780 --> 12:41.060
Just promise

12:41.540 --> 12:42.980
to return to court

12:44.540 --> 12:46.260
and serve as a puppet for the Xie Clan,

12:47.940 --> 12:49.940
and I shall sustain his life.

12:51.500 --> 12:53.500
I can hand Yu

12:54.340 --> 12:56.540
and the State of Chu to you.

13:01.660 --> 13:02.260
Zhao.

13:04.260 --> 13:05.500
Do you remember...

13:07.180 --> 13:08.300
your promise...

13:10.220 --> 13:11.580
to grant me a wish?

13:14.060 --> 13:15.060
I want you

13:16.900 --> 13:18.220
to refuse his terms.

13:19.580 --> 13:20.860
From now on, whatever wish you hold,

13:21.260 --> 13:22.500
you may ask it of me.

13:23.100 --> 13:24.820
Come fire or high water,

13:25.500 --> 13:26.700
I will see it fulfilled.

13:28.340 --> 13:29.140
I honor my promises

13:29.460 --> 13:31.700
and never renege.

14:03.020 --> 14:04.380
Forgive me, Jiu.

14:05.660 --> 14:06.540
I had to

14:07.860 --> 14:09.380
break my word now.

14:27.940 --> 14:28.540
Jiu.

14:29.500 --> 14:30.140
Jiu.

14:55.020 --> 14:56.020
In court,

14:56.020 --> 14:57.780
you follow my lead from here on.

14:58.740 --> 15:01.100
Only then can Yanlai's life be guaranteed.

15:06.380 --> 15:08.820
Frontier troop stipends shall be reduced by thirty percent,

15:09.460 --> 15:11.180
and the funds shall be redirected to the southern grain transport.

15:12.660 --> 15:14.700
Frontier troop stipends shall be reduced by thirty percent,

15:15.100 --> 15:16.860
and the funds shall be redirected to the southern grain transport.

15:17.460 --> 15:19.220
Xie Xuan from the Xie Clan...

15:20.300 --> 15:21.860
Xie Xuan from the Xie Clan...

15:22.420 --> 15:24.460
is promoted to Senior Counselor of the Grand Commandant's Office...

15:24.940 --> 15:26.860
is promoted to Senior Counselor of the Grand Commandant's Office...

15:27.700 --> 15:28.980
effective immediately.

15:29.780 --> 15:30.780
effective immediately.

15:31.780 --> 15:34.460
This year's autumn tax shall be raised by twenty percent

15:34.780 --> 15:35.940
to fill the state treasury.

15:36.620 --> 15:38.740
This year's autumn tax shall be raised by twenty percent

15:39.540 --> 15:40.740
to fill the state treasury.

15:41.140 --> 15:41.700
Your Highness,

15:42.100 --> 15:43.900
the frontier is bracing for war.

15:44.220 --> 15:45.300
Cutting military pay at such a time

15:45.620 --> 15:46.740
may not be wise.

15:49.860 --> 15:52.740
The Northern Desert has withdrawn. The frontier stands secure.

15:53.460 --> 15:54.980
No need for surplus military expenditure.

15:57.980 --> 16:00.780
The Northern Desert has withdrawn. The frontier stands secure.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.780
No need for surplus military expenditure.

16:06.380 --> 16:07.420
I believe

16:07.620 --> 16:09.740
Her Highness has a valid point.

16:10.780 --> 16:12.940
- Seconded. - Seconded.

16:14.260 --> 16:15.500
Then it is settled.

16:16.500 --> 16:17.500
What does Your Majesty think?

16:19.060 --> 16:20.660
The Grand Princess has considered everything.

16:21.460 --> 16:22.460
I am reassured.

16:47.060 --> 16:48.700
Your Majesty is still growing.

16:49.420 --> 16:50.140
Do eat more.

16:53.060 --> 16:54.340
I dreamed of Uncle Yanlai yesterday.

16:54.580 --> 16:55.300
One does not speak while eating.

16:57.300 --> 16:58.340
He was teaching me...

16:58.340 --> 16:58.900
Your Majesty.

17:01.260 --> 17:01.980
If anyone deserves your consideration,

17:02.300 --> 17:03.580
it is Uncle Yanfang.

17:04.220 --> 17:05.740
It is his supervision of the canal transport

17:06.540 --> 17:08.900
that keeps the grain from Jiangnan flowing.

17:09.460 --> 17:10.460
Without the Xie Family,

17:11.100 --> 17:13.140
How can this kingdom be held securely?

17:13.740 --> 17:15.300
Is Uncle Yanlai still alive?

17:24.740 --> 17:26.020
I will not let him die.

17:29.420 --> 17:30.260
The soup has grown cold.

17:31.020 --> 17:32.140
Fetch a hot one.

17:47.220 --> 17:48.060
She's handled

17:48.700 --> 17:49.860
all matters you entrusted

17:49.900 --> 17:50.580
during this morning's court session.

17:51.220 --> 17:52.740
She has an excellent memory.

17:54.620 --> 17:55.740
At tomorrow's court,

17:56.540 --> 17:58.620
propose a thirty-percent increase in commercial taxes,

17:59.340 --> 18:01.060
citing the reasons stated above.

18:02.700 --> 18:04.380
Has the medicine been delivered to Cangmu Stronghold?

18:04.660 --> 18:05.500
They have collected

18:05.500 --> 18:06.340
it.

18:07.620 --> 18:09.100
I gave Chu Zhao my word.

18:09.860 --> 18:11.300
As long as I draw breath,

18:13.140 --> 18:14.900
Yanlai shall not die.

18:18.540 --> 18:20.780
I cannot break faith with her.

18:35.460 --> 18:36.100
Your Highness,

18:37.620 --> 18:38.420
Mr. Xie

18:38.580 --> 18:39.820
vomited blood again this morning.

18:40.540 --> 18:41.420
The Imperial Physician fears

18:42.460 --> 18:44.340
he may not survive the winter.

18:46.020 --> 18:48.180
How many days remain

18:49.700 --> 18:50.740
until His Majesty's twelfth birthday?

18:51.340 --> 18:52.140
Your Highness.

18:53.020 --> 18:54.660
Twenty-five days.

18:58.740 --> 19:00.140
Twenty-five days.

19:11.500 --> 19:12.420
It seems

19:14.940 --> 19:16.780
I cannot pull through after all.

19:16.980 --> 19:18.100
Mr. Xie, please do not say

19:18.100 --> 19:18.900
such ominous things.

19:21.140 --> 19:23.180
Why fear death?

19:25.940 --> 19:27.740
Yu is about to take the reins himself,

19:29.740 --> 19:30.820
and he carries

19:32.300 --> 19:34.740
the blood of the Xie Family.

19:34.820 --> 19:36.340
Yet should anything happen to you,

19:36.380 --> 19:37.660
and Her Highness seizes this chance to consolidate power...

19:40.340 --> 19:42.260
I sacrificed so many lives

19:43.300 --> 19:44.740
to forge an emperor

19:44.740 --> 19:46.180
from the Xie Family.

19:47.380 --> 19:49.460
I will not let that effort go to waste.

19:50.540 --> 19:51.220
No one can resist

19:51.220 --> 19:53.340
the allure of power,

19:54.900 --> 19:56.380
especially

19:57.540 --> 19:58.940
a young emperor.

19:59.980 --> 20:02.420
A true emperor

20:03.540 --> 20:04.540
will never endure

20:04.540 --> 20:06.140
being a puppet for a lifetime.

20:07.300 --> 20:09.340
Once Yu assumes direct rule,

20:10.700 --> 20:12.540
he will never tolerate

20:12.900 --> 20:14.660
Chu Zhao's manipulation.

20:16.660 --> 20:17.780
When the time comes,

20:18.700 --> 20:20.660
we shall give him one final push.

20:23.060 --> 20:25.140
I have an agreement with Yu.

20:27.100 --> 20:28.220
The very first decree

20:28.260 --> 20:29.820
he issues upon assuming direct rule

20:32.260 --> 20:35.020
shall be the annihilation of the Chu Clan.

20:41.660 --> 20:42.260
Your Majesty,

20:43.980 --> 20:44.780
the military treatise...

20:46.740 --> 20:48.260
I have no desire to learn such things today.

20:52.500 --> 20:53.900
Uncle Yanfang said

20:54.900 --> 20:57.780
that reading people is like reading the stars.

21:01.220 --> 21:02.180
Your Majesty,

21:03.340 --> 21:05.500
the art of reading the stars is for the imperial astronomers.

21:09.460 --> 21:10.340
Grand Princess,

21:10.820 --> 21:11.780
I am the ruler,

21:12.540 --> 21:13.700
and you are my subject.

21:16.660 --> 21:18.340
Your Majesty will soon assume direct rule

21:18.780 --> 21:20.260
and must weigh all matters carefully.

21:20.780 --> 21:21.860
This is for your good.

21:23.260 --> 21:24.300
For my good?

21:24.980 --> 21:26.580
Search your heart.

21:27.340 --> 21:29.300
Do you truly hope for me to rule,

21:29.740 --> 21:30.540
or

21:31.580 --> 21:32.860
are you desperate for me

21:32.900 --> 21:33.900
to remain a puppet emperor

21:34.260 --> 21:36.380
so you may keep the reins of power?

21:37.540 --> 21:38.140
Your Majesty,

21:38.820 --> 21:39.500
I have never...

21:39.500 --> 21:40.260
Never?

21:40.940 --> 21:42.820
Why do you act with such high-handedness

21:43.340 --> 21:44.900
whenever I face critical affairs of state?

21:45.260 --> 21:47.220
Why do you obstruct me at every turn

21:47.580 --> 21:48.900
whenever I propose a different course?

21:49.980 --> 21:50.740
Chu Zhao,

21:51.260 --> 21:52.740
is the taste of absolute power

21:53.020 --> 21:54.260
so sweet

21:54.740 --> 21:55.700
that

21:56.980 --> 21:59.140
you never intended to let go?

22:05.500 --> 22:07.260
Is that truly how Your Majesty sees me?

22:07.460 --> 22:08.020
Enough.

22:09.260 --> 22:10.700
Save your excuses.

22:11.500 --> 22:12.100
Guards,

22:12.580 --> 22:14.580
escort the Grand Princess back to her palace

22:15.540 --> 22:17.140
and confine her there to reflect on her transgressions.

22:25.460 --> 22:26.100
Your Majesty,

22:27.660 --> 22:29.780
please forgive my presumption.

22:41.500 --> 22:43.540
Just as Young Master Yanfang expected.

23:11.500 --> 23:12.900
Kneel.

23:14.460 --> 23:17.780
We congratulate Your Majesty on assuming direct rule.

23:21.420 --> 23:22.420
Ministers,

23:22.780 --> 23:23.860
rise.

23:24.340 --> 23:25.820
- Thank you, Your Majesty. - Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:27.020 --> 23:27.860
My elder sister

23:28.100 --> 23:30.700
entered Taiji Hall bearing the decree of supervising the court

23:31.260 --> 23:32.980
and governed in my stead.

23:33.260 --> 23:35.140
Now that the land is at peace

23:35.580 --> 23:36.820
and I have assumed my rule,

23:37.220 --> 23:39.100
she has earned her rest.

24:03.340 --> 24:04.500
I, Chu Zhao,

24:05.020 --> 24:06.980
congratulate Your Majesty on assuming direct rule.

24:28.260 --> 24:30.420
I have an edict to announce.

24:32.500 --> 24:33.700
Why would His Majesty deliver it

24:33.740 --> 24:35.140
in person?

24:35.940 --> 24:37.540
It is the first decree

24:37.540 --> 24:38.780
of His Majesty's direct rule.

24:39.020 --> 24:40.380
It is of great significance.

24:41.500 --> 24:44.540
Upon receiving this divine charge to govern the state,

24:44.820 --> 24:45.940
I remain ever diligent,

24:46.100 --> 24:48.060
my thoughts centered solely on the state and its people.

24:48.500 --> 24:50.220
Chu Ling and Chu Zhao

24:59.780 --> 25:00.900
have demonstrated steadfast loyalty,

25:01.180 --> 25:02.740
ever mindful of the greater good of the state.

25:03.140 --> 25:04.980
The frontier is the shield of the state,

25:05.220 --> 25:06.300
upon which the state's security depends.

25:06.700 --> 25:08.780
Chu Ling, the Guard General,

25:09.340 --> 25:10.900
having stood guard at the frontier for decades,

25:11.300 --> 25:13.660
repelled invaders and secured the state with extraordinary feats.

25:14.060 --> 25:15.260
Chu Zhao, the Grand Princess,

25:15.620 --> 25:18.100
left the palace to campaign in her father's stead.

25:18.260 --> 25:20.700
Peerless in valor, united in purpose with her father,

25:20.820 --> 25:22.620
she expanded and defended the state. Their monumental achievements stand

25:23.020 --> 25:25.300
as a glorious example for all subjects of the state to follow.

25:29.700 --> 25:32.180
Yet Xie Yanfang, head of the Xie Clan,

25:32.740 --> 25:33.900
steeped in generations of imperial favor

25:34.180 --> 25:35.300
and raised to one of the Three Excellencies,

25:35.700 --> 25:37.460
was bound by duty to serve with utter devotion

25:37.740 --> 25:38.660
and uphold the order of the realm.

25:39.100 --> 25:41.140
Instead, harboring treacherous intent

25:41.380 --> 25:42.500
and behaving with monstrous depravity,

25:42.820 --> 25:44.540
he colluded with the Northern Desert bandits

25:44.780 --> 25:45.820
to invite catastrophe,

25:46.260 --> 25:48.180
[Kill Zhong Changrong at Xinggu Pass]
leaving the frontier ravaged by war

25:48.420 --> 25:49.980
and the populace displaced.

25:50.260 --> 25:52.620
By forming internal factions to purge the loyal,

25:52.820 --> 25:54.380
he sought to usurp power

25:54.580 --> 25:55.820
and deceive the throne,

25:56.100 --> 25:58.140
his crimes too numerous to recount.

25:58.620 --> 25:59.660
Most abhorrent

25:59.940 --> 26:00.980
remains the tragedy at Wei Village,

26:01.460 --> 26:03.140
where for personal gain,

26:03.540 --> 26:06.020
he emboldened foreign enemies to engage in arson and slaughter,

26:06.260 --> 26:07.700
sending the entire village

26:07.820 --> 26:08.900
to an unjust death.

26:09.100 --> 26:11.060
Such atrocities

26:11.180 --> 26:12.940
are beyond human reason,

26:13.180 --> 26:14.420
an abomination to all existence.

26:14.980 --> 26:16.020
The laws of this land are unyielding,

26:16.300 --> 26:17.860
and they will not stand for such wicked defiance.

26:18.300 --> 26:19.780
Though I ascended the throne in my youth,

26:20.100 --> 26:21.620
I bear the legacy of my ancestors

26:21.980 --> 26:23.420
and the trust of the people.

26:23.660 --> 26:25.140
I shall act with uncompromising resolve

26:25.380 --> 26:26.700
to purge all treachery and corruption.

26:27.100 --> 26:29.660
All titles and ranks of the Xie Clan are hereby stripped.

26:30.100 --> 26:31.860
Their lands, estates, silver, and valuables

26:31.980 --> 26:33.060
shall be confiscated.

26:33.460 --> 26:34.660
All adult males of the Xie Clan

26:34.780 --> 26:36.140
shall be beheaded forthwith.

26:36.340 --> 26:37.460
The women and children

26:37.500 --> 26:38.780
shall be exiled to the far frontier as slaves.

26:39.140 --> 26:41.220
Any pupils, former subordinates, or accomplices involved in his crimes

26:41.420 --> 26:42.580
must surrender within ten days.

26:42.860 --> 26:45.220
Those captured after the deadline shall face punishment threefold.

26:45.500 --> 26:47.820
This decree is proclaimed across the state.

26:48.060 --> 26:49.420
Whoever colludes with the enemy, betrays the state,

26:49.700 --> 26:51.060
or harms the people

26:51.140 --> 26:52.180
shall be executed

26:52.420 --> 26:53.460
with their entire clan,

26:53.620 --> 26:54.700
to uphold the laws of the state

26:54.940 --> 26:55.980
and serve as a warning to all.

26:56.340 --> 26:57.900
May my ministers and I together

26:58.180 --> 27:00.500
purge this corruption and restore a prosperous age.

27:01.460 --> 27:02.780
Your Majesty, please reconsider.

27:03.180 --> 27:05.500
Mr. Xie is your own in-law.

27:05.900 --> 27:06.900
Censor, mind your words.

27:07.300 --> 27:08.100
I am a Xiao,

27:08.580 --> 27:09.380
not a Xie.

27:10.100 --> 27:12.660
The state belongs to the Xiao Family.

27:13.180 --> 27:14.500
I bring down the Xie Family

27:14.980 --> 27:16.420
to save all the people.

27:17.620 --> 27:18.380
Issue the decree.

27:18.740 --> 27:20.060
Kowtow!

27:37.020 --> 27:37.540
Mr. Xie,

27:37.820 --> 27:38.380
His Majesty

27:38.900 --> 27:40.260
has decreed that your clan be purged.

27:52.220 --> 27:53.260
What did you say?

27:53.940 --> 27:54.980
This is the imperial edict

27:55.260 --> 27:56.580
His Majesty announced during this morning's court session.

27:57.060 --> 27:58.620
He proclaimed that Chu Ling and Chu Zhao's monumental achievements

27:58.820 --> 27:59.660
shall be honored by the state,

28:00.220 --> 28:00.820
while you are guilty

28:01.740 --> 28:02.780
of heinous crimes,

28:03.140 --> 28:04.300
and your entire clan

28:05.020 --> 28:05.980
is to be utterly eradicated.

28:27.020 --> 28:28.140
Absurd.

28:30.740 --> 28:32.740
Profoundly absurd.

28:35.260 --> 28:36.340
How dare he?

28:41.100 --> 28:42.260
Mr. Xie, we must leave at once.

28:42.500 --> 28:43.980
The Imperial Guard will reach Gaoyang shortly.

28:48.220 --> 28:48.980
Leave?

28:51.740 --> 28:52.980
Where to?

28:54.140 --> 28:55.780
Flee to the frontier

28:59.700 --> 29:01.580
or live in obscurity?

29:03.020 --> 29:04.860
How could I suffer

29:07.660 --> 29:10.220
such humiliation?

29:10.660 --> 29:11.300
Mr. Xie,

29:12.140 --> 29:13.140
while there is life, there is hope.

29:13.380 --> 29:14.300
We leave now

29:14.500 --> 29:15.380
and figure out

29:15.540 --> 29:16.620
the rest later.

29:46.140 --> 29:50.420
[Xie Residence]
♪Xie Yanfang betrayed the state♪

29:50.980 --> 29:55.420
♪And opened the door to the Northern Desert's blade♪

30:05.780 --> 30:06.380
Zhao,

30:07.260 --> 30:08.100
it is over.

30:13.420 --> 30:14.300
Not yet.

30:54.020 --> 30:54.900
Your Highness,

30:56.580 --> 30:58.260
it took you long enough.

31:22.020 --> 31:22.860
Look.

31:24.260 --> 31:25.740
Yanlai has finally gotten

31:26.660 --> 31:28.140
exactly what he wanted.

31:32.420 --> 31:34.340
I remember him arriving at the Xie household

31:35.660 --> 31:37.380
at eight years old.

31:38.300 --> 31:39.740
He was so timid

31:40.740 --> 31:42.300
and fearful of everything.

31:42.820 --> 31:44.740
I held his hand

31:45.500 --> 31:47.020
and taught him to read

31:47.580 --> 31:48.820
[Xie Yanlai]
and write.

31:49.740 --> 31:51.380
The very first character he learned to write

31:53.460 --> 31:55.580
was Xie, as in our family name.

31:56.860 --> 31:58.020
I told him

31:59.780 --> 32:01.180
never to forget

32:02.220 --> 32:03.740
his last name.

32:06.540 --> 32:07.580
Yet

32:08.540 --> 32:10.700
the clan elders, disdaining his lowly origins,

32:11.940 --> 32:14.260
refused to grant him the surname.

32:15.380 --> 32:17.420
So, I sent him to the Wei village to handle that business,

32:18.540 --> 32:20.060
promising that if he succeeded,

32:21.100 --> 32:22.660
I would persuade the elders

32:23.660 --> 32:25.420
to add him to the genealogy.

32:27.660 --> 32:28.820
Back then...

32:30.060 --> 32:31.260
he was over the moon.

32:33.100 --> 32:34.260
He never knew

32:35.340 --> 32:37.460
that I was the one who took Xiang...

32:39.780 --> 32:41.940
making him the lone scapegoat

32:42.540 --> 32:44.260
for the massacre at the Wei Village.

32:45.380 --> 32:46.540
And while he was investigating

32:46.580 --> 32:48.220
the Xie Family's medicinal storage,

32:48.940 --> 32:50.340
I had Du Qi

32:51.700 --> 32:53.100
kill the boy.

32:55.740 --> 32:57.020
He was just a child.

32:58.420 --> 32:59.580
What did he ever do to deserve that?

32:59.700 --> 33:01.180
His only mistake

33:02.300 --> 33:04.140
was that, after five years of captivity,

33:04.780 --> 33:07.220
he still wanted to testify for Yanlai.

33:25.900 --> 33:27.140
The irony of it all...

33:29.300 --> 33:30.460
is that the life-saving pill

33:31.260 --> 33:33.780
is useless without the second pill.

33:34.220 --> 33:35.820
My intention

33:36.420 --> 33:38.420
was that if Yanlai truly took it...

33:39.980 --> 33:41.540
I could save him

33:42.300 --> 33:44.660
when the poison set in,

33:44.900 --> 33:46.060
and he would be indebted to me

33:46.060 --> 33:47.700
for life.

33:51.300 --> 33:52.620
It comes back to me now.

33:54.540 --> 33:56.020
By a twist of fate,

33:56.900 --> 33:59.540
that is how your father met his end.

34:02.740 --> 34:05.180
Not entirely bad news, I suppose.

34:16.420 --> 34:17.460
Chu Zhao,

34:18.860 --> 34:21.020
you may bring down the Xie Family,

34:21.500 --> 34:23.980
but you cannot save Xie Yanlai.

34:25.020 --> 34:27.140
The Golden Finch Venom has no cure.

34:28.060 --> 34:29.660
He will die,

34:30.860 --> 34:34.660
and even before I do.

34:59.700 --> 35:00.860
Yanfang,

35:01.900 --> 35:03.220
despite all your calculating,

35:03.820 --> 35:06.020
you are still one move behind.

35:26.620 --> 35:27.860
Yanlai?

35:29.020 --> 35:30.260
Impossible.

35:33.260 --> 35:35.260
How are you still alive?

35:36.380 --> 35:37.420
Because all of this

35:39.460 --> 35:41.580
was a trap laid carefully for you.

35:42.900 --> 35:44.900
This dagger is forged with two sides,

35:46.380 --> 35:47.780
distinguished by gold and silver.

35:49.100 --> 35:50.100
I will coat the gold side

35:50.900 --> 35:52.700
with Golden Finch Venom in advance.

35:53.860 --> 35:55.300
We are going to stage a death scene

35:55.340 --> 35:56.340
right before his eyes.

35:57.940 --> 35:59.700
You will strike yourself with the silver, non-poisonous blade.

35:59.980 --> 36:00.660
The wound, however,

36:01.900 --> 36:03.220
must look absolutely real.

36:04.500 --> 36:05.780
Only a lie built upon a grain of truth

36:05.980 --> 36:07.260
can deceive them all.

36:08.180 --> 36:10.020
I will play the part of a hostage, forced back to the court

36:11.060 --> 36:12.860
to serve as his puppet, day after day.

36:14.800 --> 36:18.300
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

36:20.300 --> 36:21.660
I could kill Xie Yanfang,

36:22.540 --> 36:23.340
even at the cost of my own life.

36:23.780 --> 36:24.180
No.

36:24.780 --> 36:25.900
There will always be

36:26.340 --> 36:27.740
another Xie Yanfang.

36:28.700 --> 36:29.940
We must leverage the Xie Family's influence

36:30.020 --> 36:30.980
to keep the court in check,

36:31.640 --> 36:32.900
until Yu takes the reins.

36:33.940 --> 36:34.740
Yes, Your Highness.

36:37.940 --> 36:39.100
From that moment on,

36:39.660 --> 36:41.460
everything you saw was a lie.

36:42.620 --> 36:44.580
I knew you were after the Frontier Troops Token,

36:45.180 --> 36:46.660
so I instructed Zhong

36:46.860 --> 36:47.860
to feign submission.

36:49.340 --> 36:50.420
What I failed to account for

36:51.380 --> 36:52.460
was how far you would sink,

36:52.460 --> 36:53.580
raising your blades against the Longwei Army.

36:54.220 --> 36:55.700
This is the medicine Xie Yanfang sent.

36:56.420 --> 36:57.500
Using the cover of my convalescence

36:57.500 --> 36:58.260
at Cangmu Stronghold,

36:58.780 --> 37:00.420
I've been quietly gathering evidence of the Xie Family's crimes.

37:01.220 --> 37:02.020
Yet you were so intoxicated

37:02.020 --> 37:03.500
by the thrill of pulling every string

37:03.980 --> 37:04.900
that you let your guard down entirely.

37:04.980 --> 37:06.740
The officials you have promoted

37:07.220 --> 37:08.380
also allowed me to compile a complete list

37:08.380 --> 37:09.740
of the Xie Family's faction

37:09.820 --> 37:10.660
within the court.

37:11.060 --> 37:11.860
Jiu and I

37:12.780 --> 37:13.420
have always been working

37:13.420 --> 37:14.780
behind your back,

37:15.260 --> 37:16.020
tirelessly molding Yu

37:16.020 --> 37:17.500
into a capable ruler.

37:18.260 --> 37:19.180
Yunzhong Prefecture

37:19.660 --> 37:21.060
is the frontier stronghold of the Capital,

37:21.420 --> 37:22.220
easy to defend and hard to breach.

37:22.620 --> 37:24.020
But should the Northern Desert resolve its internal strife,

37:24.020 --> 37:24.860
return with force,

37:25.260 --> 37:26.940
and bring the surrounding minor states into the fold,

37:27.340 --> 37:29.540
a flanking assault could spell trouble.

37:29.660 --> 37:31.020
May I then send envoys

37:31.180 --> 37:32.780
to build ties with neighboring states and avoid war?

37:33.020 --> 37:34.500
A wise thought, Your Majesty.

37:35.660 --> 37:36.780
Military strength and diplomacy

37:37.100 --> 37:38.020
are both essential

37:38.060 --> 37:39.420
to the art of governance.

37:39.820 --> 37:42.300
Bear in mind that the greatest victory is to avoid war.

37:42.540 --> 37:43.260
Peace

37:43.900 --> 37:45.620
is what endures.

37:46.700 --> 37:47.740
Hold the sword as you would a fist.

37:48.420 --> 37:50.580
Loosen your grip even once, and all is lost.

37:52.220 --> 37:53.700
Zhao, I understand.

37:55.580 --> 37:57.100
Ruling is like a game of strategy.

37:57.420 --> 37:58.740
It matters not who moves first,

37:59.180 --> 38:01.980
only who has the last laugh.

38:03.660 --> 38:05.740
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

38:05.740 --> 38:07.180
Much like what you are doing now.

38:09.760 --> 38:12.640
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

38:13.160 --> 38:15.700
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

38:15.700 --> 38:16.500
Yanfang,

38:16.980 --> 38:19.060
you always said the noble families were deeply entangled.

38:20.580 --> 38:22.260
So we learned from you,

38:22.780 --> 38:25.820
traced each root to its source,

38:26.460 --> 38:27.340
and

38:27.980 --> 38:29.260
pulled them all out.

38:36.540 --> 38:37.220
Yanlai,

38:38.540 --> 38:39.620
since you are alive,

38:40.300 --> 38:41.820
why not come home?

38:43.300 --> 38:44.500
After I pass away,

38:44.780 --> 38:46.660
the immense power of the Xie Family

38:46.660 --> 38:47.620
and the position of clan head

38:47.900 --> 38:49.260
will all be yours.

38:50.900 --> 38:52.980
Why make such a choice?

38:54.580 --> 38:56.780
What exactly are you trying to do?

38:58.260 --> 38:59.180
No one reads hearts well

38:59.220 --> 39:00.420
as you do.

39:02.180 --> 39:03.260
How can you not know

39:04.260 --> 39:05.500
that what I want

39:06.900 --> 39:07.660
is to take

39:07.660 --> 39:10.300
the Xie Family's century-old legacy with me to the grave?

39:24.220 --> 39:25.100
The clan elders

39:25.100 --> 39:26.580
must regret not killing me

39:27.820 --> 39:29.580
when they could,

39:30.460 --> 39:31.820
only for me, too low-born

39:31.820 --> 39:33.020
to enter the genealogy

39:35.820 --> 39:37.100
to end the Xie's bloodline for good.

39:38.220 --> 39:39.060
Yanlai.

39:40.940 --> 39:43.340
Seeing you like this, so deranged,

39:44.860 --> 39:46.860
I almost see myself.

39:50.860 --> 39:51.580
Indeed.

39:52.900 --> 39:55.140
I am the baby wolf you spent years shaping.

39:57.820 --> 39:58.540
Remember,

39:59.500 --> 40:00.660
my brother?

40:03.820 --> 40:04.940
We've won

40:06.700 --> 40:08.260
this game after all.

40:09.380 --> 40:10.220
Good.

40:12.500 --> 40:13.700
Splendid.

40:22.740 --> 40:23.580
Yanfang,

40:24.140 --> 40:25.260
do you know

40:25.900 --> 40:26.780
why you lost this game?

40:29.700 --> 40:30.980
For all your plotting,

40:30.980 --> 40:32.100
you forgot one thing.

40:33.740 --> 40:35.380
The most brilliant schemes

40:36.620 --> 40:38.020
are the ones that ensnare their maker.

40:39.340 --> 40:40.700
Xie Yanfang, you were so confident

40:41.100 --> 40:41.900
that you never doubted

40:41.900 --> 40:42.900
you were the one

40:42.900 --> 40:43.740
moving the pieces.

40:43.980 --> 40:45.740
Little did you know

40:45.740 --> 40:47.100
the very web you wove

40:47.820 --> 40:49.380
would be the one to close around you.

40:50.660 --> 40:51.540
Surprising, isn't it?

40:53.180 --> 40:53.940
The piece

40:55.020 --> 40:56.900
you thought to command at will

40:58.100 --> 40:58.780
has made you

40:59.780 --> 41:01.820
a discarded pawn of fate.

41:18.380 --> 41:18.980
Mr. Xie,

41:19.740 --> 41:21.060
Her Highness is but a woman.

41:21.660 --> 41:22.540
What does she have

41:22.940 --> 41:23.980
that makes you treat her

41:23.980 --> 41:24.860
so differently?

41:26.260 --> 41:26.900
She is...

41:29.300 --> 41:29.940
different.

41:31.780 --> 41:32.500
Chu Zhao.

41:51.260 --> 41:52.820
A move made is a move set.

41:54.060 --> 41:54.820
I lost.

41:56.420 --> 41:57.260
And I own it.

42:30.820 --> 42:32.220
I see no difference

42:32.900 --> 42:34.420
between people.

42:35.340 --> 42:36.740
But once a difference appears,

42:37.500 --> 42:39.100
the heart tilts.

42:39.980 --> 42:41.460
And a tilted heart

42:42.540 --> 42:45.340
becomes a prison.

42:50.620 --> 42:51.700
From this day onward,

42:52.500 --> 42:55.260
taxes across all prefectures shall be reduced by thirty percent.

42:55.940 --> 42:57.740
- Your Majesty is wise. - Your Majesty is wise.

42:58.180 --> 42:58.700
Furthermore,

42:59.300 --> 43:00.900
the laws of the State of Chu shall be revised.

43:01.700 --> 43:03.540
Anyone found colluding with foreign powers

43:04.140 --> 43:05.060
shall be held collectively responsible,

43:05.660 --> 43:06.820
and their entire clan shall be exterminated.

43:54.660 --> 43:58.460
♪Day after day, across these ancient hills♪

43:58.460 --> 44:02.260
♪Again and again, the old city cold and still♪

44:02.260 --> 44:05.020
♪Through dust and battle, I look back♪

44:05.020 --> 44:08.260
♪And find you waiting at journey's end♪

44:09.820 --> 44:13.700
♪Night after night, the hours drift on♪

44:13.700 --> 44:17.420
♪Year after year, our reunions end too soon♪

44:17.420 --> 44:22.140
♪Love so deep, yet fate so thin, why must it be so hard?♪

44:24.260 --> 44:28.180
♪Through joy and sorrow, we have shared it all♪

44:28.180 --> 44:31.980
♪Bound by a knowing no words can name♪

44:31.980 --> 44:35.420
♪Two lonely souls, huddling together for warmth♪

44:36.460 --> 44:38.580
No luck with the hares, so you're after me now?

44:38.860 --> 44:40.380
You're just easier to catch.

44:41.020 --> 44:42.300
Every creature on these grasslands

44:42.460 --> 44:43.460
is cunning.

44:43.460 --> 44:46.820
♪I sigh at the whims of merciless fate♪

44:46.820 --> 44:47.780
I just had

44:49.180 --> 44:50.260
a nightmare.

44:51.940 --> 44:53.980
So even you have fears, General Xie?

44:55.300 --> 44:56.860
In the dream, death tore us apart.

45:00.300 --> 45:01.660
Don't say that.

45:02.620 --> 45:04.220
We still have many years ahead of us.

45:05.780 --> 45:06.380
Agreed.

45:08.740 --> 45:09.740
Then we shall guard

45:09.740 --> 45:10.780
Yunzhong Prefecture side by side,

45:11.780 --> 45:12.660
day after day,

45:13.980 --> 45:14.940
year after year,

45:15.820 --> 45:16.700
to the very end.

45:19.500 --> 45:20.380
I intend

45:21.460 --> 45:22.940
to expand the place

45:23.620 --> 45:24.380
where I used to live.

45:25.860 --> 45:27.500
Why the rush to renovate?

45:28.180 --> 45:29.020
There is every reason.

45:41.100 --> 45:42.380
I want to marry you.

45:42.820 --> 45:45.060
